flowchart TD
  Root(["How do I stop causing<br/>these harms to people I care about?"])
  Root --> Q1["What is an example<br/>of a harm that was caused?"]
  Q1 --> Q2["What does the other person consider a harm<br/>that I don't consider a harm?"]
  Q2 --> Q3["Why don't I consider it a harm,<br/>and they do?"]
  Q3 --> Q4["Why do I not see the future impact<br/>when I'm doing something<br/>I don't know will cause harm?"]
  Q4 --> Q5["How can I become aware of the harm<br/>my actions will cause, without losing<br/>pieces of myself I don't want to give up?"]
  Q5 -. needs an example, circle back .-> Q1
  Q5 --> Q6["Why do I ignore the other person's complaints,<br/>or not take them seriously enough<br/>to want to change my behavior?"]
  Q6 --> Q7["How can I make better choices<br/>to help the relationship, without losing<br/>the pieces of myself I want to keep?"]
